# CODEOWNERS — required reviewers for protected paths
# See docs/advisories/ADVISORY-003.md for the supply-chain rationale
# behind pinning dependency files behind mandatory review.
#
# Adjust `@netbones/platform` to the actual team that owns the
# supply-chain / platform surface. If a per-path owner is more
# appropriate (e.g. `@netbones/frontend` for `package.json`), split
# the rules below.

# Default — every change needs eyes
*                                       @netbones/platform

# Supply-chain critical paths
# package.json + pnpm-lock.yaml are the highest-blast-radius files
# in the repo. A malicious entry here lands in every install.
/package.json                           @netbones/platform
/pnpm-lock.yaml                         @netbones/platform
/.npmrc                                 @netbones/platform
/pnpm-workspace.yaml                    @netbones/platform

# CI workflows that gate supply
/.github/workflows/                     @netbones/platform
/.github/CODEOWNERS                     @netbones/platform
/.github/dependabot.yml                 @netbones/platform
/renovate.json                          @netbones/platform
/.github/renovate.json                  @netbones/platform
